   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 3  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Roads built and trade infrastructure established. 
Indicator: About 1.2 km of access road between Pasakha industrial estate and India constructed 
Achievement: 1.2 
Progress/Status: 1.2 km of access road between Pasakha industrial estate and India was completed by June 2019 under following three packages: 

Package 1: Construction of Bhalujhora Bridge on June 2019 
Package 2: Construction of multi-cellular box culvert, land custom station and roadworks on May 2019
Package 3: Construction of Gabion structure on March 2019

Procurement of additional equipment and vehicles: (i) Snow clearing machine - 3 nos., (ii) Handheld roller machine - 6 nos., (iii) pick-up truck - 1 no., and (iv) customized vehicle for Road Asset Management - 1 no. was completed in Dec 2022 
Data Source: Monitoring reports and PCR by DOR and Phuentsholing Thromde
Pre- and post- evaluation o training participants by DOR</narrative>
    </description>
